</ul>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_ZFAD" id="published-packages">Published packages<a href="https://naver.github.io/egjs-flicking/releases/2026/07/09/release-4.16.2#published-packages" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Published packages" title="Direct link to Published packages" translate="no">​</a></h2>
