<li class=""><code>@egjs/vue3-flicking@4.16.2</code></li>
</ul>
<p>Internal changes: repaired the CI test workflow for the pnpm monorepo, reorganized docs demos (CrossFlicking preset, reactive demos replacing legacy advanced demos), and realigned e2e specs. See the PR list below for details.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_ZFAD" id="whats-changed">What's Changed<a href="https://naver.github.io/egjs-flicking/releases/2026/07/09/release-4.16.2#whats-changed" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to What's Changed" title="Direct link to What's Changed" translate="no">​</a></h2>
