<li class="">chore(ci): fix broken test workflow for pnpm monorepo by @cjw783 in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/947" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/947</a></li>
<li class="">fix: error on removePanel for unseen panel by @malangfox in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/946" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/946</a></li>
<li class="">docs: llms 가이드 추가 by @daybrush in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/943" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/943</a></li>
<li class="">release: core 4.16.2 (버그 수정 + CI 정비 + 데모/문서 개편) by @cjw783 in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/948" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/948</a></li>
<li class="">fix(docs): replace CrossFlicking demo &amp; docs by @cjw783 in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/944" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/944</a></li>
<li class="">Fix/reactive api demo by @cjw783 in <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/945" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/pull/945</a></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href="https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/compare/4.16.1...4.16.2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://github.com/naver/egjs-flicking/compare/4.16.1...4.16.2</a></p>]]></content>
